{"id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-subdirect-product.md","title":"Subdirect Embedding","display":"df-subdirect-product — Subdirect Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-subdirect-product","aliases":["93-df-subdirect-product"],"display":"df-subdirect-product — Subdirect Embedding","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-subdirect-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-subdirect-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subdirect-product — Subdirect Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B(i))\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B(i))\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the product and coordinate-projection constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(-,-,-;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(-,-,-;I,\\tau)\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subdirect\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\bigl(e,\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e,\n\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e\\bigr)\n[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B(i)|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subdirect\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\bigl(e,\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e,\n\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e\\bigr)\n[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B(i)|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A subdirect embedding is an algebra embedding into a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-indexed direct product whose every coordinate map is surjective; the factor family is an explicit function graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}$ and $\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}$ are the product and coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-product]]; $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ are the sourced predicates.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf B:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B(i))","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(-,-,-;I,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subdirect\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf B:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B(i))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\bigl(e,\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e,\n\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B(i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}(i;\\mathbf B,I)\\circ e\\bigr)\n[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B(i)|\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"3296916b733e08cd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]."},{"id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is an algebra candidate and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate sourced through [[93-df-subdirect-product]]."},{"id":"3bbb7b7bf7df9f89","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ are the sourced predicates of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]] and [[93-df-subdirect-product]]."},{"id":"730edd22d82070e5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]] and [[93-df-subdirect-product]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirect-product]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","260c377f5e1dcfdf","d611f4ac8b8895ab","f10e7e3251fa7f7d"]}